Title: Synth Sample
Author: Hardening Sprint

INT. KITCHEN - MORNING

ANNA pours coffee. She looks tired but resolved.

ANNA
Today is the day. No more waiting.

She picks up her keys and walks out the door.

EXT. SIDEWALK - CONTINUOUS

ANNA walks briskly. BOB approaches.

BOB
(surprised)
You're up early.

ANNA
First day of the rest of it.

FADE OUT.
